WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Welcome to dinner for all the teams

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:02.875
who have to play on Thanksgiving!

00:00:03.041 --> 00:00:04.833
I brought my famous green bean casserole

00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:06.708
It’s pretty good, but it’s not gonna win any awards

00:00:06.708 --> 00:00:07.833
I wish we could go out to the bar

00:00:07.833 --> 00:00:09.416
tonight like the other teams

00:00:09.416 --> 00:00:10.875
ELI, IT’S BEEN YEARS!

00:00:10.875 --> 00:00:11.958
HOW YOU BEEN, MAN?!

00:00:11.958 --> 00:00:13.666
We’re undefeated in November!

00:00:13.666 --> 00:00:15.250
YO, JAMES CONNER IS DOING KARAOKE!

00:00:18.583 --> 00:00:20.291
We’ve got some exciting news in the middle

00:00:20.291 --> 00:00:21.625
of this Gridiron Heights episode

00:00:21.625 --> 00:00:23.958
PS4 and VR Bundles are starting at $199

00:00:23.958 --> 00:00:25.000
during Black Friday week!

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:25.583
GOBBLE, GOBBLE

00:00:25.583 --> 00:00:27.250
Taysom, more pepper!

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:28.166
Hey man, let me take that

00:00:28.166 --> 00:00:29.125
I think you’re finished

00:00:29.125 --> 00:00:30.291
Pass this around to Khalil

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:31.291
Just pass left, Mitchell

00:00:31.291 --> 00:00:31.875
A toast!

00:00:31.875 --> 00:00:33.291
We may not see all of you next year—

00:00:33.291 --> 00:00:33.708
Wait, what?

00:00:33.708 --> 00:00:34.958
But we love coming together

00:00:34.958 --> 00:00:36.166
To friendly competition!

00:00:36.166 --> 00:00:37.916
Careful, Matt, don’t choke

00:00:37.916 --> 00:00:39.625
WHERE’S DREW’S MVP, SEAN?!

00:00:39.625 --> 00:00:40.500
SIT UP STRAIGHT

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:42.166
BE FANCY AND PROFESSIONAL LIKE ME

00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:43.708
Hey, Stafford, you want seconds?

00:00:43.708 --> 00:00:44.541
Uh, sure

00:00:44.541 --> 00:00:45.541
I’m Colt McCoy

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:47.708
and I’m still the most popular quarterback in Texas

00:00:47.708 --> 00:00:49.250
THE NFC EAST COULD BE MINE

00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:50.250
INTERCEPTION

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:51.208
I BLAME THE FANS

00:00:51.208 --> 00:00:52.416
TAYSOM, START THE CAR

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:53.375
Already done, sir

00:00:53.375 --> 00:00:55.375
Hey, what exactly is Taysom Hill’s job?

00:00:55.375 --> 00:00:56.541
NOBODY KNOWS

00:00:56.541 --> 00:00:58.083
I could kick Dan Quinn’s ass

00:00:58.083 --> 00:00:58.791
I’m good now

00:00:58.791 --> 00:01:00.000
Happy Thanksgiving

